  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Independent Diplomat</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Three year agreement. Core support to Independent Diplomat. Independent Diplomat is an NGO that works to strengthen the ability of legitimate but marginalized political actors in developing countries to use political and diplomatic means. Thus, the organization helps to create a greater degree of symmetry in dialogue processes and more generally to prevent conflict. ID also works with the Meet the Parties project in the UN, where they arrange meetings between members of the Security Council and rebel groups to ensure the former a broader basis for decision-making. Last but not least, they work with women, peace and the security agenda.</narrative>
  </description>
